        {
          "text": "Bukeye imiryango yose y’ Abisirayeli ija i Heburoni kwa Dawidi, baramubarira, bat’ Ehe rāba, tur’ akara kamwe n’amaraso amwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.5.1",
