          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yamaze imyaka ndwi n’amezi atandatu i Heburoni, aganza Abayuda; i Yerusalemu na ho ahamara imyaka mirongwitatu n’itatu, aganza bose Abisirayeli n’Abayuda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.5.5",
