            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 5:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuko Dawidi aca atahura yuk’ Uhoraho ari we yamuteretse ngw abe umwami w’ Abisirayeli, kandi kw ashize hejuru ubgami bgiwe kubg’ abantu biwe b’Abisirayeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.5.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
